  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Deepening and Broadening Access to Financial Services in Mozambique</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through active engagement with a range of public and private stakeholders working at the macro, meso and micro levels, deepen and broaden the Mozambican financial sector contributing towards the Government of Mozambique&#x2019;s target of increasing financial inclusion to 35% (over 2 million beneficiaries) and supporting the provision of financial services to over 650 Micro, Small and Medium sized Enterprises (SMME&#x2019;s) over 6 years.</narrative>
  </description>
